# Files the fromlittleonward.com project does not upload.
#
# This project has no build step: Vercel serves every uploaded file as-is, so
# anything not listed here is public at fromlittleonward.com/<path>. Keep
# working files (class scripts, drafts, reviews, tooling) out of the deploy.
#
# The nsc project (Root Directory nsc/) has its own nsc/.vercelignore. Vercel
# falls back to this file for a monorepo project without one, and the /nsc
# rule below would then drop the class app's whole source, so keep that file.

# The class app is its own Vercel project, reached through the /nsc rewrite.
/nsc

# Paid class scripts and the AI tutor's sources. api/ reads the prebuilt
# api/_knowledge-data.js, not these files.
/knowledge
/course

# keel: the tool pages load keel/lib/*.mjs and keel/artifacts/**/*.json in the
# browser; the reviews, research notes, graders and scripts stay private.
/keel/*
!/keel/lib
!/keel/artifacts

# Working folders and tooling.
/docs
/marketing
/evals
/corpus
/scripts
/tests
/library
/tools/library
/.github
/.impeccable
/.serena
/.agents
/.claude
/.fg-gate
/.taste-skill
/_redirects
/skills-lock.json
/.env.example

# Notes, readmes and local databases anywhere in the tree.
*.md
*.db
